 lots to do, so let\u2019s get started: create a new iOS app using the Single View App template, naming it \u201ciExpense\u201d. We\u2019ll be using that for the main project, but first lets take a closer look at the new techniques required for this project\u2026","topics":[],"score":248463,"global_rank":65002},{"name":"jardiamj/CSC143_Utility","owner":"jardiamj","html_url":"https://github.com/jardiamj/CSC143_Utility","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Utility tools for CSC143 class - Java II","topics":[],"score":248463,"global_rank":65004},{"name":"jpyces/network.sh","owner":"jpyces","html_url":"https://github.com/jpyces/network.sh","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":248461,"global_rank":65008},{"name":"huskyroboticsteam/PSoC_Project_Template","owner":"huskyroboticsteam","html_url":"https://github.com/huskyroboticsteam/PSoC_Project_Template","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"A template that can be cloned to create other project repos","topics":[],"score":248453,"global_rank":65017},{"name":"JeremyOT/SlideMenu","owner":"JeremyOT","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyOT/SlideMenu","stars":2,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":248451,"global_rank":65021},{"name":"jimmymac387/practical-statistics","owner":"jimmymac387","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmymac387/practical-statistics","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Notes and scripts from \"Practical Statistics for Data Scientists\"","topics":[],"score":248449,"global_rank":65024},{"name":"schintatkun/MacOSX-WebDev-Setup","owner":"schintatkun","html_url":"https://github.com/schintatkun/MacOSX-WebDev-Setup","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Web Development Setting MaxOSX","topics":[],"score":248449,"global_rank":65026},{"name":"U